WEBVTT

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:15.750
Full energy is troubled because there's no place to go

00:00:16.210 --> 00:00:22.030
A slight shake destroys boredom

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:28.170
I Ride, On the White Line  OH, OH, OH

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:34.240
Sit Down  At the place I trust  OH, OH, OH

00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:37.540
We can go even if we're lost

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:43.650
Everyone receives freedom and passion

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:49.850
We were born to shine, and our journey continues

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:56.060
Your soul is the key that supports our uncertain days

00:00:56.350 --> 00:01:02.000
The best growth creates an unstoppable WILD DRIVE

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:08.270
We still quietly knock on the door

00:01:19.550 --> 00:01:25.270
Since you can't beat my brother fairly, you dredge up an old story to distract him?

00:01:25.270 --> 00:01:26.720
That won't work!

00:01:26.720 --> 00:01:31.500
Our bond isn't as weak as Noa and The Big Five believe.

00:01:32.040 --> 00:01:34.360
Look!  My brother won!

00:01:34.360 --> 00:01:38.930
When my brother gets a bit serious, The Big Five have no chance!

00:01:40.010 --> 00:01:46.020
Mystery Deepens  Noa's Identity

00:01:46.400 --> 00:01:49.820
Mokuba?  You don't hate Seto?

00:01:49.820 --> 00:01:51.740
Even after he betrayed you?

00:01:51.960 --> 00:01:57.040
As long as I can help my brother, I don't care what hardships I face!

00:02:00.890 --> 00:02:03.370
Wealth, talent and power...

00:02:03.370 --> 00:02:05.980
I was blessed with everything since birth.

00:02:05.980 --> 00:02:09.290
No one had something that I didn't.

00:02:09.290 --> 00:02:12.050
I never envied anyone.

00:02:12.410 --> 00:02:18.220
So I never thought Seto would have something that I didn't.

00:02:18.220 --> 00:02:19.350
But...

00:02:19.560 --> 00:02:26.280
Mokuba, why are you willing to forsake yourself for your brother?

00:02:27.060 --> 00:02:29.740
What Seto has that I don't...

00:02:30.230 --> 00:02:32.960
...is Mokuba.

00:02:35.160 --> 00:02:39.170
So I'll steal the only thing that Seto cherishes.

00:02:39.970 --> 00:02:42.340
You really love your brother.

00:02:43.720 --> 00:02:50.720
Even though you're devoted to him, how does he think about you?

00:02:50.960 --> 00:02:53.630
My brother and I are like one!

00:02:53.630 --> 00:02:55.650
I trust my brother!

00:02:55.880 --> 00:03:01.110
Really?  I wonder what Seto thinks about you.

00:03:03.970 --> 00:03:05.440
Big brother!

00:03:06.310 --> 00:03:08.910
You've come for me!

00:03:11.880 --> 00:03:14.350
Stay away!  You're a burden!

00:03:15.550 --> 00:03:17.010
What are you talking about?

00:03:17.220 --> 00:03:20.010
You're always in my way.

00:03:20.010 --> 00:03:23.350
I'm better off without you.

00:03:26.780 --> 00:03:27.550
Big brother!

00:03:31.140 --> 00:03:33.560
Big brother!

00:03:37.460 --> 00:03:39.660
No way...  Big brother...

00:03:39.880 --> 00:03:42.080
Seto is awful.

00:03:43.730 --> 00:03:48.430
If he cared about you, he wouldn't have said those things.

00:03:48.640 --> 00:03:51.580
I'll take care of you forever.

00:03:54.750 --> 00:03:57.450
I can protect you.

00:03:58.650 --> 00:03:59.820
Noa.

00:04:09.800 --> 00:04:11.700
Good, Mokuba.

00:04:11.700 --> 00:04:14.620
I'm your big brother from now on.

00:04:14.950 --> 00:04:17.370
Noa...  Big brother...

00:04:21.250 --> 00:04:22.550
Big brother...

00:04:23.250 --> 00:04:24.620
Big brother...

00:04:25.600 --> 00:04:26.680
Mokuba?

00:04:33.460 --> 00:04:35.190
Is he inviting me?

00:04:38.410 --> 00:04:39.560
The road!

00:04:39.780 --> 00:04:44.230
Seto, your dear brother belongs to me.

00:04:44.230 --> 00:04:47.130
Wait, Noa!  Leave Mokuba alone!

00:04:47.420 --> 00:04:50.300
Wait, Kaiba!  We'll come with you!

00:04:51.660 --> 00:04:53.370
This doesn't concern you!

00:04:54.220 --> 00:04:55.300
What?

00:04:55.600 --> 00:04:57.900
This is our problem!

00:04:57.900 --> 00:04:59.900
We don't need your help!

00:05:02.350 --> 00:05:03.950
You idiot!

00:05:03.950 --> 00:05:07.050
I'll never care about you again!

00:05:07.050 --> 00:05:10.250
Yugi, you don't have to either!

00:05:10.250 --> 00:05:11.150
That's right!

00:05:11.150 --> 00:05:12.690
We don't need to go after him!

00:05:13.020 --> 00:05:16.130
Let's find an escape route on our own!

00:05:17.260 --> 00:05:20.360
You need to get my body back first!

00:05:20.360 --> 00:05:24.030
Yeah.  We can't leave Honda like this.

00:05:24.960 --> 00:05:26.660
That's right!

00:05:26.660 --> 00:05:28.850
Shizuka, you're so nice.

00:05:28.850 --> 00:05:32.800
Otogi is a meanie.  Right, Shizuka?

00:05:33.660 --> 00:05:36.500
Stop rubbing up on Shizuka!

00:05:39.260 --> 00:05:41.180
I can't let him go alone.

00:05:41.180 --> 00:05:43.130
You wait here.

00:05:43.760 --> 00:05:45.000
Hey!  Yugi!

00:05:45.000 --> 00:05:46.090
I'm going too!

00:05:46.500 --> 00:05:47.570
Anzu!

00:05:48.580 --> 00:05:51.460
Sheesh!  They're hopeless!

00:05:51.460 --> 00:05:54.260
Brother, don't you have to go with them?

00:05:54.260 --> 00:05:55.980
Leave them be.

00:05:55.980 --> 00:05:59.400
Even if I go, Kaiba will think I'm in the way.

00:05:59.400 --> 00:06:00.680
That's right.

00:06:00.680 --> 00:06:04.420
It's all his fault to start with.

00:06:04.420 --> 00:06:05.540
But...

00:06:06.110 --> 00:06:07.290
I'm going too!

00:06:07.290 --> 00:06:09.560
Shizuka!  Dammit!

00:06:09.560 --> 00:06:11.690
Why does everyone-

00:06:11.690 --> 00:06:13.170
Otogi!  Let's go!

00:06:14.760 --> 00:06:15.900
Wait!

00:06:24.240 --> 00:06:26.940
Yugi!  Anzu!

00:06:36.720 --> 00:06:39.530
He's still pulling pranks!

00:06:45.040 --> 00:06:46.110
Big brother...

00:06:46.430 --> 00:06:47.250
Mokuba!

00:06:56.350 --> 00:06:57.530
Big brother.

00:06:58.280 --> 00:06:59.260
Mokuba!

00:07:04.300 --> 00:07:05.920
You!

00:07:13.740 --> 00:07:15.960
Which way did Kaiba go?

00:07:16.110 --> 00:07:17.290
This way!

00:07:18.200 --> 00:07:20.480
Anzu, how do you know?

00:07:20.760 --> 00:07:23.220
Women's intuition.

00:07:23.540 --> 00:07:25.790
Women's intuition?

00:07:26.770 --> 00:07:28.870
Wait, Anzu!

00:07:36.200 --> 00:07:37.670
What's that light?

00:07:37.670 --> 00:07:40.200
See?  We took the correct path.

00:07:40.420 --> 00:07:41.600
Let's go!

00:07:50.620 --> 00:07:52.040
Where are we?

00:07:57.850 --> 00:08:01.790
I don't think they want us to enter.

00:08:02.660 --> 00:08:05.000
Yugi, do you hear that?

00:08:05.760 --> 00:08:07.730
What's that sound?

00:08:12.040 --> 00:08:14.740
You're right.  Someone is crying.

00:08:15.260 --> 00:08:18.580
Yeah!  It's a crying baby!

00:08:18.940 --> 00:08:20.480
Let's enter!

00:08:36.540 --> 00:08:38.780
What's taking so long?

00:08:39.080 --> 00:08:41.360
I'll see what's going on.

00:08:41.700 --> 00:08:45.600
Have they lost before I could defeat them?

00:08:46.320 --> 00:08:49.380
I'm the one who'll send them to hell.

00:08:50.280 --> 00:08:52.740
Don't take away my fun.

00:08:58.880 --> 00:09:00.350
The fog's rolling in.

00:09:02.100 --> 00:09:04.790
Be careful.  I have a bad feeling about this.

00:09:05.360 --> 00:09:06.220
Yeah.

00:09:06.480 --> 00:09:09.220
I wonder if Yugi is okay.

00:09:24.220 --> 00:09:26.340
Noa!

00:09:28.220 --> 00:09:29.540
Mokuba!

00:09:29.540 --> 00:09:35.120
Noa, I regret taking even the slightest bit of interest in you.

00:09:35.340 --> 00:09:42.280
By taking Mokuba hostage to gain the advantage, it proves you're not greater than me!

00:09:43.250 --> 00:09:44.910
You're mistaken.

00:09:46.050 --> 00:09:49.770
Your foolish former employees did everything.

00:09:51.470 --> 00:09:54.470
I saved Mokuba from them.

00:09:54.680 --> 00:09:58.140
You should thank me instead of complaining.

00:10:01.220 --> 00:10:02.660
Mokuba, let's go.

00:10:04.920 --> 00:10:06.240
What's wrong, Mokuba?

00:10:08.020 --> 00:10:09.200
Come with me.

00:10:09.200 --> 00:10:10.340
No!

00:10:11.780 --> 00:10:14.020
I'm staying with my brother Noa!

00:10:14.020 --> 00:10:17.630
I'm staying with Noa forever!

00:10:18.220 --> 00:10:19.850
Mokuba...

00:10:19.850 --> 00:10:22.570
Noa!  What did you do to Mokuba?

00:10:22.820 --> 00:10:24.260
Hypnotism?

00:10:24.260 --> 00:10:27.300
What's so fun about messing with my brother!

00:10:27.300 --> 00:10:28.720
Hypnotism?

00:10:28.720 --> 00:10:33.080
A cheap trick can't change a person's heart.

00:10:33.680 --> 00:10:36.510
Mokuba found out who you really are.

00:10:36.720 --> 00:10:38.680
What did you tell Mokuba?

00:10:39.220 --> 00:10:42.380
We heard Daimon's story.

00:10:42.380 --> 00:10:46.310
You knew Mokuba wouldn't betray you, so you used him.

00:10:46.310 --> 00:10:51.120
And you secretly changed the name on Mokuba's stock to yours.

00:10:51.890 --> 00:10:55.060
You're wrong!  You believed Daimon's lies?

00:10:55.280 --> 00:10:57.420
Is it really lies?

00:10:57.420 --> 00:11:02.240
Mokuba!  You believe their lies instead of me?

00:11:04.870 --> 00:11:06.680
Poor thing.

00:11:06.680 --> 00:11:09.560
Mokuba is scared.  Let's go.

00:11:11.520 --> 00:11:14.240
You dare control Mokuba's heart with lies?

00:11:14.460 --> 00:11:17.250
You want to defeat me that badly, Noa?

00:11:18.680 --> 00:11:20.680
Defeat you?

00:11:25.000 --> 00:11:31.200
I knew you were conceited, but I didn't know you were this egotistical.

00:11:31.420 --> 00:11:32.370
What?

00:11:32.370 --> 00:11:36.970
Even before we fight, it's been decided that I'll win.

00:11:36.970 --> 00:11:41.140
Because you're my fake rival, Seto.

00:11:41.950 --> 00:11:44.710
I'm your fake rival?

00:12:05.140 --> 00:12:06.240
Anzu!

00:12:08.260 --> 00:12:09.240
Find him?

00:12:09.240 --> 00:12:10.060
No.

00:12:24.960 --> 00:12:26.780
Anzu!  Over here!

00:12:29.540 --> 00:12:31.080
It's a rattle.

00:12:31.080 --> 00:12:33.120
But where's the baby?

00:12:33.120 --> 00:12:37.900
Maybe this is when Kaiba was a baby.

00:12:38.120 --> 00:12:39.950
That doesn't sound right.

00:12:39.950 --> 00:12:44.800
Kaiba was adopted into this family when he was about 10 years old.

00:12:44.800 --> 00:12:46.350
Oh yeah.

00:12:55.220 --> 00:12:56.950
What is it, Yugi?

00:12:57.650 --> 00:12:58.950
This is...

00:12:58.950 --> 00:12:59.890
What?

00:13:08.960 --> 00:13:11.060
What's this?

00:13:14.430 --> 00:13:18.970
Seems there's something important in there.

00:13:21.620 --> 00:13:23.230
Error.

00:13:24.100 --> 00:13:25.460
Lock.

00:13:25.460 --> 00:13:26.850
Refuse to access.

00:13:28.130 --> 00:13:31.930
I know you're in there, Yugi!

00:13:45.030 --> 00:13:46.260
What's wrong?

00:13:46.260 --> 00:13:49.310
Honda!  If you don't quiet down, I'll disassemble you!

00:13:52.000 --> 00:13:56.940
What are you doing this time to get Shizuka's attention?

00:13:59.000 --> 00:14:00.660
A monster!

00:14:01.570 --> 00:14:02.950
You're the monster!

00:14:03.820 --> 00:14:05.000
Say what!

00:14:05.000 --> 00:14:07.140
There's something in the water!

00:14:07.140 --> 00:14:13.520
You're only saying that so you can hug Shizuka's breasts again!

00:14:17.960 --> 00:14:19.200
What?

00:14:23.240 --> 00:14:24.740
What do you want?

00:14:24.740 --> 00:14:28.040
You all lost!  Why are you here?

00:14:28.040 --> 00:14:31.980
To steal your young bodies, of course.

00:14:32.540 --> 00:14:34.410
We already dueled!

00:14:34.410 --> 00:14:37.240
Yes.  We lost our duels.

00:14:37.240 --> 00:14:38.440
But...

00:14:39.280 --> 00:14:40.500
Brother!

00:14:40.500 --> 00:14:41.860
Don't worry.

00:14:41.860 --> 00:14:45.290
No matter how many times we duel, I'll never lose.

00:14:45.580 --> 00:14:47.480
Who's challenging me this time?

00:14:47.480 --> 00:14:49.960
Or do I duel you all simultaneously?

00:14:49.960 --> 00:14:53.230
We're not going to play anymore.

00:14:53.740 --> 00:14:54.500
What?

00:14:54.500 --> 00:14:58.170
We'll take your bodies by force.

00:14:58.170 --> 00:15:00.320
That's allowed?

00:15:04.640 --> 00:15:06.080
Go!

00:15:07.520 --> 00:15:09.120
So annoying!

00:15:19.240 --> 00:15:21.160
Jonouchi!  Hurry!

00:15:23.060 --> 00:15:25.270
Damn!  What's wrong?

00:15:39.360 --> 00:15:40.750
Brother!

00:15:40.960 --> 00:15:42.680
C'mon, start!

00:15:42.970 --> 00:15:45.510
I said "Start," you piece of junk!

00:15:47.950 --> 00:15:49.040
It started!

00:15:55.750 --> 00:15:57.970
I'm your fake rival?

00:15:57.970 --> 00:15:59.330
What do you mean?

00:16:00.110 --> 00:16:03.770
I haven't told you the real story yet.

00:16:03.770 --> 00:16:05.150
Real story?

00:16:12.240 --> 00:16:14.610
You and Gozaburo?

00:16:18.620 --> 00:16:19.680
Yugi?

00:16:20.000 --> 00:16:21.420
Kaiba?

00:16:23.460 --> 00:16:25.830
Look at this, Kaiba.

00:16:27.970 --> 00:16:28.760
This is...

00:16:29.150 --> 00:16:31.310
A young Gozaburo.

00:16:31.310 --> 00:16:33.700
Noa is by his side.

00:16:43.760 --> 00:16:44.880
Who's this?

00:16:45.200 --> 00:16:47.320
He looks like you.

00:16:47.610 --> 00:16:50.320
He's also smart, just like you.

00:16:50.770 --> 00:16:54.680
I think you're no match for him.

00:16:55.640 --> 00:16:57.400
Caught your attention?

00:16:57.400 --> 00:17:00.200
It's no fun to study alone.

00:17:00.200 --> 00:17:04.870
So Seto will be your rival in your studies to be king.

00:17:05.080 --> 00:17:10.300
Noa, prove that you're superior to him in every way.

00:17:10.520 --> 00:17:16.040
If you do, you will be Kaiba Corporation's true heir.

00:17:16.560 --> 00:17:20.750
Okay.  It'll be simple, Father.

00:17:21.710 --> 00:17:23.020
Father?

00:17:23.320 --> 00:17:24.690
What's going on?

00:17:26.480 --> 00:17:31.380
I'm Noa Kaiba.  Gozaburo Kaiba's only real son.

00:17:32.020 --> 00:17:37.200
To motivate me to study harder, he decided to create a rival.

00:17:37.200 --> 00:17:39.880
Seto even looked like me.

00:17:39.880 --> 00:17:42.800
That's why he adopted you.

00:17:43.200 --> 00:17:48.740
You're a fake rival to motivate a thoroughbred like me to run faster.

00:17:49.420 --> 00:17:54.680
Even though you're a fake, you ousted my father and took over Kaiba Corporation.

00:17:55.110 --> 00:17:56.350
You!

00:17:56.350 --> 00:17:58.080
Now you know.

00:17:58.080 --> 00:18:05.310
I invited you here to prove to my late father that I'm better than you.

00:18:05.310 --> 00:18:08.760
And I will inherit Kaiba Corporation.

00:18:08.980 --> 00:18:11.700
Nonsense!  This isn't true!

00:18:11.980 --> 00:18:18.250
If your story is true, you can't be Gozaburo's son!

00:18:19.250 --> 00:18:21.570
What are you talking about?

00:18:24.280 --> 00:18:29.510
Stop!  The Big Five will take your young bodies!

00:18:30.480 --> 00:18:31.680
Everyone!

00:18:32.820 --> 00:18:34.710
Such troublemakers.

00:18:34.710 --> 00:18:38.320
Seto, we'll talk later.

00:18:38.320 --> 00:18:39.520
Wait, Noa!

00:18:52.510 --> 00:18:53.740
Brother!

00:18:53.740 --> 00:18:55.500
I can handle it!

00:19:12.640 --> 00:19:14.230
Otogi!  Are you okay?

00:19:14.680 --> 00:19:16.660
Yeah.  I'm fine.

00:19:16.880 --> 00:19:17.900
Shizuka!

00:19:21.140 --> 00:19:24.480
Which body shall I take?

00:19:26.400 --> 00:19:29.710
I'll take the girl.

00:19:29.710 --> 00:19:32.880
Hold on!  I'm taking her!

00:19:32.880 --> 00:19:37.120
What?  I thought you wanted the other girl.

00:19:37.120 --> 00:19:41.120
All young girls are mine!

00:19:41.480 --> 00:19:43.520
Stop being selfish!

00:19:43.520 --> 00:19:45.420
What are you doing?

00:19:48.090 --> 00:19:50.330
Stop arguing!

00:19:50.330 --> 00:19:52.430
We're running out of time!

00:19:52.660 --> 00:19:53.840
But-

00:19:53.840 --> 00:19:54.650
Silence!

00:19:55.100 --> 00:19:56.400
I don't care which one.

00:19:56.400 --> 00:19:59.480
Let's take their bodies now!

00:20:08.420 --> 00:20:09.480
Noa!

00:20:09.860 --> 00:20:15.420
If you won't obey me, I'll erase you all!

00:20:15.640 --> 00:20:17.690
Please wait, Noa!

00:20:18.340 --> 00:20:20.090
No excuses!

00:20:39.460 --> 00:20:41.120
Otogi!  Are you all right?

00:20:42.360 --> 00:20:43.720
That was close.

00:20:43.730 --> 00:20:44.850
Hey guys!

00:20:45.970 --> 00:20:48.590
Thank goodness!  You're okay!

00:20:48.590 --> 00:20:50.270
Yugi!

00:20:54.020 --> 00:20:56.180
You're okay too!

00:20:57.470 --> 00:20:59.250
Shizuka, are you all right?

00:20:59.250 --> 00:21:00.810
Yes, Anzu.

00:21:03.940 --> 00:21:05.020
Kaiba.

00:21:05.920 --> 00:21:10.770
Why did you say that Noa couldn't be Gozaburo's real son?

00:21:10.770 --> 00:21:18.540
If those virtual images were real, I joined the Kaiba family over six years ago.

00:21:21.620 --> 00:21:25.360
Gozaburo is even younger in this photo.

00:21:29.680 --> 00:21:32.310
Noa hasn't aged at all!

00:21:33.130 --> 00:21:35.350
What does that mean?

00:21:43.000 --> 00:21:47.730
Noa's identity remains a mystery, but we have to rescue Mokuba!

00:21:47.730 --> 00:21:50.460
Oh!  And regain Honda's body!

00:21:50.460 --> 00:21:52.910
Huh?  Honda is over there!

00:21:52.910 --> 00:21:55.440
One of The Big Five is inside.

00:21:55.440 --> 00:21:57.800
What?  All five are inside?

00:21:57.930 --> 00:22:01.730
The Big Five start a final duel for Honda's body.

00:22:01.730 --> 00:22:03.820
Please, Yugi and Jonouchi!

00:22:03.820 --> 00:22:05.730
Regain Honda's body!

00:22:05.730 --> 00:22:08.370
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
The Big Five's Counterattack

00:22:08.370 --> 00:22:09.820
Duel, standby!

00:22:13.750 --> 00:22:21.650
The sun never sets
It rises forever

00:22:21.650 --> 00:22:30.600
Don't let a dream end as a dream

00:22:30.930 --> 00:22:35.570
The straight rail and harsh route

00:22:35.570 --> 00:22:39.540
Whether to go or not 
all of yourself

00:22:39.970 --> 00:22:47.510
I'm tired of counting on my fingers inside this cage

00:22:47.510 --> 00:22:51.080
Respect! Boys  Show me how you act tough

00:22:51.080 --> 00:22:55.850
Draw a map, even if it's sloppy

00:22:55.850 --> 00:23:05.960
And walk it without stopping

